            "review_title": "Review at Lambro Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "Al C\nMelbourne, Victoria, Australia34 contributions\n0\nA Brilliant Suprise\nJun 2025 • Friends\nWow.\nWe found this be default, just searching for air-conditioning!\nThe food was absolutely amazing, the best food I've had in my three weeks in Vietnam.\nTrust me on this one, its excellent. \nThe owner told us they only recently opened, so don't be fooled by the lack of reviews.\nThey also do live jazz & cocktails out the back on Friday & Saturdays.\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2025",
